WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.340 --> 00:00:04.760
Spoiler alert: Game of Thrones isn't a series
known for its happy endings.

00:00:04.760 --> 00:00:08.400
And fans certainly aren't getting many in
the show's final season.

00:00:08.400 --> 00:00:12.540
Several major characters met their end in
the fifth episode of season 8, and now the

00:00:12.540 --> 00:00:16.660
actor who played Varys has revealed that he
wasn't thrilled with how his story ended.

00:00:16.660 --> 00:00:20.740
Speaking with Entertainment Weekly, Conleth
Hill opened up about the experience of seeing

00:00:20.740 --> 00:00:25.500
his character burned to death by the Mad Queen
Daenerys, saying he took it "very personally."

00:00:54.800 --> 00:00:59.460
There was some bright side for Hill, though,
as he felt Varys died a "noble" death after

00:00:59.460 --> 00:01:03.710
the Master of Whispers revealed to the world
the true parentage of Jon Snow in an attempt

00:01:03.710 --> 00:01:08.200
to make sure Westeros had a better ruler than
the vengeful and sadistic Daenerys.

00:01:17.820 --> 00:01:21.320
"If he dislikes one monarch, he conspires
to crown the next one.

00:01:21.320 --> 00:01:23.280
What kind of servant is that?"

00:01:23.540 --> 00:01:25.520
"The kind the realm needs.

00:01:25.740 --> 00:01:28.840
Incompetence should not be rewarded with blind
loyalty."

00:01:29.160 --> 00:01:30.400
Hill continued,

00:01:42.840 --> 00:01:47.780
Still, the death stings, especially considering
how little Varys has been given to do over

00:01:47.780 --> 00:01:49.120
the past two seasons.

00:01:49.120 --> 00:01:53.020
If you were frustrated by that, well, you're
not alone, as Hill revealed he wasn't too

00:01:53.020 --> 00:01:54.880
happy with his character's arc either.

00:02:29.680 --> 00:02:34.260
Hill also said that he felt like Varys was
acting out of character in those two seasons,

00:02:34.260 --> 00:02:38.260
as the master spy suddenly seemed to have
no idea what was going on, and exerted no

00:02:38.260 --> 00:02:39.720
influence over events.

00:02:56.520 --> 00:03:01.100
Overall, though, Hill stressed that his experience
on Game of Thrones has been "brilliant."

00:03:01.100 --> 00:03:04.000
And he doesn't think fans will be disappointed
with the series finale.

00:03:07.460 --> 00:03:09.780
Well…all except one, anyway.

